{"type":"text","timestamp":1778980015027,"sessionID":"ses_1cc885b9fffe3OQbM3nZ0uAKXI","part":{"id":"prt_e3378b448001Vfc4VSM0R7fGGz","messageID":"msg_e3378891600117WP4bbH5b3EYW","sessionID":"ses_1cc885b9fffe3OQbM3nZ0uAKXI","type":"text","text":"I’ve identified a likely nuance: the new umbrella term should probably sit above the two issue-listed children, and there is a third existing RNU12-associated ataxia term that may also belong under it. I’m checking similar MONDO gene-spectrum terms so I can avoid creating an inconsistent hierarchy.","time":{"start":1778980009032,"end":1778980015025}}}
